msgid "According to Lab Chapter 1900, Occupational Safety and Health. it is mandatory to keep emergency lighting functional and clean. Several emergency lights throughout the warehouse are lit very dimly or not at all, so you must change the bulb in those emergency lights. The bulbs are usually found in warehouse 5 and are in a small green box of one. Find the bulbs and replace them in the emergency lights."
msgstr "根据实验室第 1900 章“职业安全与健康”。必须保持应急照明功能正常且清洁。整个仓库的几个应急灯都很暗或根本不亮，因此您必须更换这些应急灯的灯泡。这些灯泡通常可以在 5 号仓库中找到，装在一个绿色的小盒子里。找到灯泡并将其更换到应急灯中。"

#. Key:	F127CDC9448DEDD9F962318ABDF63523
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_11.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_11.Text
msgctxt ",F127CDC9448DEDD9F962318ABDF63523"
msgid "Task: Object inspection."
msgstr "任务：物体检查。"

#. Key:	4ADB5D3142534A7C56ABB1B19D4B85C7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_12.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_12.Text
msgctxt ",4ADB5D3142534A7C56ABB1B19D4B85C7"
msgid "An alarm was set off in the offices but security systems say it was a mistake. Go to the offices and turn off the alarm. Then you need to go through the entire building and make sure no one is here. Then the task will be completed."
msgstr "办公室的警报set已关闭，但安全系统表示这是一个错误。前往办公室并关闭警报。然后你需要走遍整栋大楼并确保没有人在这里。那么任务就完成了。"

#. Key:	3644F3F94DF6AF1678A892A46FC15552
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_13.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_13.Text
msgctxt ",3644F3F94DF6AF1678A892A46FC15552"
msgid "Task: Maintenance of fire extinguishers."
msgstr "任务：维护灭火器。"

#. Key:	A143244F42FABD4A25AD57B1CE5F7176
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_14.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_14.Text
msgctxt ",A143244F42FABD4A25AD57B1CE5F7176"
msgid "By law, fire extinguishers must be kept working and clean. There is always one fire extinguisher on the Emergency Boards. This must be replaced with a new one. Take the old fire extinguishers and put them in the wooden box by the main gate. New fire extinguishers can be found in storage room 4 in one of the rooms. Take them and put them on the Emergency Boards. Once all the fire extinguishers on the Emergency Boards have been replaced, the task will be completed.  "
msgstr "根据法律规定，灭火器必须保持工作状态且清洁。应急板上始终备有一个灭火器。必须更换新的。把旧的灭火器拿出来放在大门旁边的木箱里。新的灭火器可以在其中一间房间的 4 号储藏室中找到。把它们拿走并把它们放在紧急委员会上。一旦应急板上的所有灭火器都被更换完毕，任务就完成了。"

#. Key:	54AE9EEF41A0E4084181C68545EC2534
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_15.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_15.Text
msgctxt ",54AE9EEF41A0E4084181C68545EC2534"
msgid "Task: Maintenance of flashlights."
msgstr "任务：手电筒的维护。"

#. Key:	1E2D3F6C43B5D28141AC2B8588B1F791
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_16.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_16.Text
msgctxt ",1E2D3F6C43B5D28141AC2B8588B1F791"
msgid "By law, you must keep emergency flashlights operational. There is always one flashlight on the Emergency Boards. It needs to be charged because it will probably be dead. To charge it, you must use the special fast chargers located in Storage Room 4 in one of the rooms. After charging the flashlight, return it to the emergency board. Once all flashlights on all Emergency Boards are charged, the task will be completed."
msgstr "根据法律规定，您必须保持应急手电筒正常工作。应急板上总是备有一只手电筒。它需要充电，因为它可能会死掉。要充电，您必须使用位于其中一间房间的 4 号储藏室中的专用快速充电器。手电筒充电后，将其放回应急板上。一旦所有应急板上的所有手电筒都充满电，任务就完成了。"

#. Key:	BB4CD58C42EC270AD052AFB472D40EB2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_17.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_17.Text
msgctxt ",BB4CD58C42EC270AD052AFB472D40EB2"
msgid "Task: Violation of Security Systems"
msgstr "任务：违反安全系统"

#. Key:	653CB6F1419AFF17442594B65416F062
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_18.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_18.Text
msgctxt ",653CB6F1419AFF17442594B65416F062"
msgid "An unauthorized person entered the building. He breached the security system and set off the alarm. You need to disarm the alarm and detain the person. Be careful, he could be dangerous. The task will be completed once the person has been apprehended and the alarms have been disabled."
msgstr "一名未经授权的人员进入大楼。他突破了安全系统并set关闭了警报。您需要解除警报并拘留该人。小心点，他可能很危险。一旦该人被逮捕并且警报被禁用，任务就会完成。"

#. Key:	28FA6A4847E204E9339FCAB448DECBF0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_19.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_19.Text
msgctxt ",28FA6A4847E204E9339FCAB448DECBF0"
msgid "Task: Maintenance of the Disinfectant."
msgstr "任务：维护消毒剂。"

#. Key:	FBD8E39D431AF5E0F54E6EBAFE24DAA5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_2.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_2.Text
msgctxt ",FBD8E39D431AF5E0F54E6EBAFE24DAA5"
msgid "The power supply to some of the electrical equipment has failed. It is necessary to restart the power generator manually. Go to the power generator and restart it. After shutting down the power generator, you will need to disconnect all computers from the power grid so that they do not crash when the power generator is restarted. I understand it's a retarded system, but there's no other way. Once all the computers have been unplugged, turn the power generator back on."
msgstr "部分用电设备供电出现故障。需要手动重启发电机。转到发电机并重新启动它。关闭发电机后，您需要断开所有计算机与电网的连接，以免发电机重新启动时计算机崩溃。我知道这是一个迟钝的系统，但没有其他办法。拔掉所有计算机的插头后，重新打开发电机。"

#. Key:	38B792EC4DDBB49AFF90DF9A388AED0B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_20.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_20.Text
msgctxt ",38B792EC4DDBB49AFF90DF9A388AED0B"
msgid "By law, it is necessary to keep the disinfectant clean and full. There is always one disinfectant on the Emergency Boards. This must be replaced with a new one. Remove the old disinfectant and place it in the wooden box by the main gate. New disinfectants can be found in the oil store. Take them and put them on the Emergency Boards. Once all the disinfectants on the Emergency Boards have been replaced, the task will be completed.  "
msgstr "根据法律规定，必须保持消毒剂清洁、充足。急救板上总是备有一种消毒剂。必须更换新的。将旧消毒剂取出，放入大门旁的木箱内。油库里可以找到新的消毒剂。把它们拿走并把它们放在紧急委员会上。一旦应急板上的消毒剂全部更换完毕，任务就完成了。"

#. Key:	E5DA228940405E5873C9E2809B55A0FF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_3.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_3.Text
msgctxt ",E5DA228940405E5873C9E2809B55A0FF"
msgid "Task: Fixing a leaking toilet."
msgstr "任务：修理漏水的厕所。"

#. Key:	C65131AA4B2B97279C1E878E9A05D59A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_4.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_4.Text
msgctxt ",C65131AA4B2B97279C1E878E9A05D59A"
msgid "There's a leaking toilet in the men's room. Find the tools to fix the toilet and fix the toilet. I don't know where the tools are, but look in a workshop somewhere. I'll give you an idea of what it looks like. You'll need a long red wrench. When you find it, find the leaking toilet and fix it properly. Then you'll have accomplished the task."
msgstr "男厕所的厕所漏水。找到修理马桶的工具，修理马桶。我不知道工具在哪里，但可以在某个地方的车间里看看。我会让你知道它是什么样子的。你需要一把长的红色扳手。找到后，找到漏水的马桶并妥善修复。那么你就完成了任务。"

#. Key:	45438E1542E306F95D9263ADAE44982D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_438.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_438.Text
msgctxt ",45438E1542E306F95D9263ADAE44982D"
msgid "In warehouse 4, several light bulbs were burned out, probably some asshole was playing with the voltage in the power grid again. The bulbs need to be replaced. You'll find boxes of bulbs in random places around the warehouse, marked in yellow with a picture of the bulb. Replace the damaged bulbs in the lights and replace them with new ones."
msgstr "4号仓库里，好几个灯泡都烧坏了，估计是哪个混蛋又在玩弄电网电压了。灯泡需要更换。您会在仓库周围的随机位置找到成箱的灯泡，并用黄色标记并附有灯泡的图片。更换灯中损坏的灯泡并更换新灯泡。"

#. Key:	D8A870E8445981ABC718F0ABD466647E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_5.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_5.Text
msgctxt ",D8A870E8445981ABC718F0ABD466647E"
msgid "Task: New product!"
msgstr "任务：新产品！"

#. Key:	66217A8F449AF35CD7F4A28B79CAFDF8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_6.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_6.Text
msgctxt ",66217A8F449AF35CD7F4A28B79CAFDF8"
msgid "They've imported new goods! Go check it out, they say it's some kind of robot, new technology or something. Brown's a sucker for new stuff. I don't know exactly what it does, but if you miss it, you're in fucking trouble. Put it back in the box and close it up. I just want you to check it, not destroy it."
msgstr "他们进口了新货！去看看吧，他们说这是某种机器人，新技术什么的。布朗对新事物很着迷。我不知道它到底有什么作用，但如果你错过了它，你就有麻烦了。将其放回盒子中并关闭。我只是想让你检查它，而不是毁掉它。"

#. Key:	DEE480EF42C0CF2F128F6E9B1AE50161
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_7.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_7.Text
msgctxt ",DEE480EF42C0CF2F128F6E9B1AE50161"
msgid "Task: Restore electrical circuits."
msgstr "任务：恢复电路。"

#. Key:	2F7930644CFCE21175CC54A439F3B566
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_8.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_8.Text
msgctxt ",2F7930644CFCE21175CC54A439F3B566"
msgid "In front of the door to the offices there is a substation for electrical circuits. There are 4 buttons and 2 levers. Each of the buttons can only be activated if you restore power to the electrical circuit of that button. To restore the electrical circuit, find the circuit substation and activate it with the lever, then press the red lit button next to the electrical circuit substation. Once you have activated all the electrical circuits and pressed all the buttons in the electrical circuit substation, you will be able to activate two levers. "
msgstr "办公室门前有一个电路变电站。有 4 个按钮和 2 个控制杆。仅当恢复每个按钮电路的电源后才能激活该按钮。要恢复电路，请找到电路变电站并用控制杆将其激活，然后按下电路变电站旁边的红灯按钮。一旦您激活了所有电路并按下了电路变电站中的所有按钮，您将能够激活两个控制杆。"

#. Key:	528764EE4F796C11CC0B2E9257B8C733
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/Blueprint/Monitor/Storage_PC_Widget.Storage_PC_Widget_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_9.Text
