#. Key:	29D173384AD9F6D77D1E2280C55ECCB3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/MainMenu/W_Secret.W_Secret_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
#: /Game/MainMenu/W_Secret.W_Secret_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",29D173384AD9F6D77D1E2280C55ECCB3"
msgid "This text will be displayed for the next 34 seconds. It shows the secret story connecting all Galactic Games. \r\nThis text has a font size of 34. Most values in BloodLight are equal to 34 or multiples thereof.\r\n Tony is Samuel's grandfather. \r\nHe worked at the SRF where the whirlwind took him to infinity. Hey, Sam. Are you okay, Sam? \r\nWhat's going on? \r\nWhat happened? Where's Grandpa? You know, it's hard. He's stuck, isn't he? Somewhere in the multiverse. \r\nWe don't know where Sam might be. We can't find him. The Science Reserch Facility won't look for him. They think it's pointless. \r\nBut you can handle it, can't you? I'm sorry, but it's impossible to search infinity. \r\nIt's impossible. \r\nHenry! Come here. Give him a little hope, he's still small. I guess he is.\r\n Okay. Okay. Okay. Sam! Sam! Sam! Yes? (laughs) Don't worry, Grandpa will be back. \r\nHe's smart. I'm sure he can find his way back. January 27, 1992.\r\n You must be strong. Don't worry, I'll cure you. Soon you'll be like everyone else. \r\nAnd how will you do that, Dad? \r\nDon't worry about it. I have to go. Get some rest. I have work to do. March 29, 1992. If \r\nDad was here, he'd know how to do it. I can't let her down. I won't let her down. I have to figure it out. This is gonna change the world. I'll take any disease. I can make Project 34 a success.\r\n Doctor Henry Brown? Yes, I will. Come with me. Is something wrong? Yes, Doctor Brown, the government is cutting off our funding and will have to close some departments and stop some projects. We're sorry, but Project 34 is one of them. \r\nAle to nemůžete! Budužel můžu. Vláda totu chce zrušit. Považuje to tu za nebezpečné pro svět. Blbost všechno tu je hlídané. Ale váš  otec to posral. \r\nTo byla poslední kapka. Je jenom otázka času než to tu zavřou a pak nás všechny popraví, jinak to nepůjde. 18. Duben 1992. Nikdo mě nezastaví dokončím to co jsem začal. Moje cera bude volná. 22. Listopad 1994. \r\nScience Reserch Facility byla uzavřena z \r\ndůvodu potencionálního nebezpečí která ohrožovala okolní svět. 20. Prosinec 1994. \r\nLidé viděli zvláštní věci, \r\nkteré byly vyváženy pod plachtamy z Science Reserch Facility \r\nokolo 2 hodiny raní po dobu 4 týdnů. George Davies bývalý zaměstnanec Science Reserch Facility řekl: \r\nStudoval jsem cesty mezi vesmíry. Bylo to hrozné každý den jsem se bál jestli se vrátím domů. \r\nBylo to tak tajné. Něco vám ale řeknu (\") nebyl dobrej nápad fakt ne. 31. Prosinec 1994."
msgstr ""

